{
  "pageId": "P3",
  "intent": {
    "topic": "三类模拟证据支持先做限量试点，改善结果仍需验证",
    "topicPlacement": "Skin 主题条",
    "groups": [
      {
        "id": "evidence-demand-fact",
        "role": "analysis",
        "message": "8 周 120 份申请中，74 份来自三个课程项目集群，占 61.7%；其中 52 份申请了相同的 GPU 环境模板。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#evidence-demand-fact"
        ],
        "emphasis": "primary",
        "medium": "text"
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence-demand-interpretation",
        "role": "interpretation",
        "message": "需求集中意味着统一模板可能减少重复确认，但不代表这些项目一定适合放在同一权限范围内。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#evidence-demand-interpretation"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text",
        "relatesTo": [
          "evidence-demand-fact"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence-record-fact",
        "role": "analysis",
        "message": "78 份完成运行的记录中，14 份缺少实际参数或输出位置，缺口率为 17.9%；14 份中有 9 份来自两个项目集群。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#evidence-record-fact"
        ],
        "emphasis": "primary",
        "medium": "text"
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence-record-interpretation",
        "role": "interpretation",
        "message": "这个分布支持先针对少量项目补齐字段和责任人，而不是直接把入口扩大到全部申请；它没有证明缺口由某一个申请人或某一字段单独造成。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#evidence-record-interpretation"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text",
        "relatesTo": [
          "evidence-record-fact"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence-capacity-fact",
        "role": "analysis",
        "message": "峰值周全量人工审核预计需要 5.0 个管理员工作日，高于每周 3.5 个可支配工作日；限量 5 个项目的试点预计需要 2.6 个工作日，模板稳定后预计降到 1.4 个。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#evidence-capacity-fact"
        ],
        "emphasis": "primary",
        "medium": "text"
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence-capacity-interpretation",
        "role": "interpretation",
        "message": "两组数字都是工作量估计，实际负荷需用阶段二的运行记录校准。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#evidence-capacity-interpretation"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text",
        "relatesTo": [
          "evidence-capacity-fact"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "synthesis-trial-case",
        "role": "interpretation",
        "message": "需求集中、记录缺口集中和人工容量约束分别回答“是否有可重复的入口”“哪里需要先补证据”“为什么不能一次全量开放”。三类证据的交集支持 B 的试点范围和三周评审节奏；它们只支持提出一个可检验的行动方案，不支持宣称已经提升效率。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#synthesis-trial-case"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text",
        "relatesTo": [
          "evidence-demand-fact",
          "evidence-record-fact",
          "evidence-capacity-fact"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "boundary-evidence",
        "role": "context",
        "message": "模拟观察没有随机对照，8 周窗口也可能受课程周期影响；“集中”可能只是活跃项目较多，不等于未来需求稳定。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#boundary-evidence"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text"
      },
      {
        "id": "validation-plan",
        "role": "annotation",
        "message": "阶段二应记录每次申请的完整字段、首次可用时间、管理员实际工时和异常闭环时间；阶段三按预先写明的三个扩围条件复核。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#validation-plan"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text"
      },
      {
        "id": "conditional-action",
        "role": "annotation",
        "message": "若记录不完整或工作量超过容量，暂停扩围并保留当前规模。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          "content-draft.json#conditional-action"
        ],
        "emphasis": "secondary",
        "medium": "text"
      }
    ],
